Dawn, Walking Away
[trigger none]
[vignette dungeons/relay_post]

FIXME(mundane): First light comes through the cleared dust. You pick up your pack without speaking. Devra is at her desk. Ossal is at the brazier. Neither of them looks at you. Neither of them tries to keep you.

FIXME(dread): Outside, the mesa is quiet. What happens between Devra and Ossal after you leave is no longer your business. She may run. He may act. The relay may stay open or go dark. You do not know which.

FIXME(revelation): You walk back toward the main road. You wonder if you will appear in an official Kesharat report now. You wonder what the mysterious Kesharat system will make of your choice. You also wonder if you brought enough food to make it back to a settlement, and for now that question seems more important than the others.

choices:

* Take the road north = Put the post behind you and walk
    +flee_dungeon
